---
import ButtonLink from "../ButtonLink.astro";
import Card from "../Card.astro";
import CardSubtitle from "../CardSubtitle.astro";
import CardText from "../CardText.astro";
import CardTitle from "../CardTitle.astro";
---

<Card variant="project-2">
  <CardTitle>University & Accelerator Programs - startup creation and development</CardTitle>
  <CardSubtitle>UNIMORE & E.R. | OCT 2022 - JAN 2024</CardSubtitle>
  <CardText>
    <a href="https://tacc.unimore.it/en/" class="link">TACC</a> alum: participated in the entrepreneurial academic
    course offered by <a href="https://international.unimore.it/" class="link">UNIMORE</a>, focused on developing a
    business idea in a multidisciplinary team with the aim of launching a business in the automotive field.
  </CardText>
  <CardText>
    The project created by our team during the TACC, called BeyonTouch, was a finalist in the <a
      class="link"
      href="https://www.startcupemiliaromagna.it/">Start-Cup</a
    > 2023 accelerator program of the Emilia Romagna region.
  </CardText>
  <CardText>
    BeyonTouch also completed the hardware acceleration program <a href="https://techup.dd-re.it/" class="link"
      >Tech-Up</a
    > 2023.
  </CardText>
  <ButtonLink
    link={{
      href: "https://beyontouch.carrd.co/",
      label: "Project Page",
      ariaLabel: "BeyonTouch project page link",
      variant: "secondary",
    }}
  />
</Card>
